      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Nothing here grades itself: gold labels are human decisions, and the suite only ever asks whether today's rules still reach yesterday's hard-won\nanswers.",
      "originalText": "Nothing here grades itself: gold labels are human decisions, and the suite only ever asks whether today's rules still reach yesterday's hard-won answers.",
